rl":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T16:31:40Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T17:39:13Z","body":"> so let's remove the android specific guards.\r\n\r\nI'm sure that this is bad idea. \r\nInstead of hiding `scripts_panel` (this may be OK for android, but for desktop this will be _extremely_ annoying) occupied space should be used more efficiently. Some panels like audio panel and `scripts_panel` just use too much free vertical space (minimum size could be reduced). \r\nI did some experiments here https://github.com/arkology/godot/tree/mimimizer, so it may be possible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616296171/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616370615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101828#issuecomment-2616370615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101828","id":2616370615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b8qW3","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T16:59:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T16:59:42Z","body":"Note that this does not fix #26835 with the Android guards included and I agree that simply removing them is not a good idea. At there should be a check whether the bottom panel does really need the extra space.\r\n\r\nbtw when the script panel is forcibly hidden, you can still click the < button to open it and trigger the bug anyway.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616370615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616457413","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101828#issuecomment-2616457413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101828","id":2616457413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b8_jF","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-27T17:31:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T17:31:32Z","body":"I agree that this is not the best solution, but I couldn't come up with a better approach. The issue lies in the fact that the elements (child nodes) of the scripts_panel take up some vertical space and it cannot be reduced further. The only viable solution I could think of is to hide the `scripts_panel`.\n\nIf this method doesn't seem appropriate, we can add an editor setting to toggle this behavior until a better solution is found.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616457413/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2616491495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101828#issuecomment-2616491495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101828","id":2616491495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6b9H3n","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_